			"Message": "chore(Wind): Remove tracked generated files from Source/Effect/Generated/\n\n516 generated TypeScript service interface files were being tracked in git,\nconstantly showing spurious diffs (CRLF/LF whitespace noise) that pollute\nthe working tree. Remove these from version control so they can be properly\nignored via .gitignore in the next commit.\n\nThese files are produced by code generation during the build and should\nnever have been committed.",
