			"Message": "feat(Wind): Add generated bridge shape types for all upstream services\n\nIntroduce `Pick<…>` bridge shape type aliases and their matching globals interfaces for 16 workbench and configuration services. Each file defines the exact subset of upstream properties the Wind Live layer depends on, ensuring any upstream rename or removal surfaces as a TypeScript build error.\n\nServices covered: UserSettings (IConfigurationService), WorkbenchActivity (IActivityService), WorkbenchClipboard (IClipboardService), WorkbenchCommand (ICommandService), WorkbenchContextKey (IContextKeyService), WorkbenchDialog (IDialogService), WorkbenchEditor (IEditorService), WorkbenchExtension (IExtensionService), WorkbenchHost (IHostService), WorkbenchKeybinding (IKeybindingService), WorkbenchLifecycle (ILifecycleService), WorkbenchNotification (INotificationService), WorkbenchProduct (IProductService), WorkbenchProgress (IProgressService), WorkbenchStorage (IStorageService), and WorkbenchWorkspace (IWorkspaceContextService).\n\nAll files regenerated from upstream sources by Wind/Codegen. The `tsconfig.tsbuildinfo` is refreshed to reflect the new source set.\n\nNo manual edits — all changes are codegen output.",
			"SHA": "388ff684be4f170bb506ca4cb09f351877335aaf"
		}
